                "raw": "<b>The Deathwing Ancient is equipped with:</b> storm bolter; power fist. <br><br><b>The Deathwing Apothecary is equipped with:</b> storm bolter; chainfist. <br><br><b>The Deathwing Champion is equipped with:</b> halberd of Caliban. <br><br><b>Every Deathwing Command Terminator is equipped with:</b> storm bolter; power fist.",
